ent-WeaponPsykerForceStaffBiomantic = biomantic force staff
    .desc = A psychically-attuned force stave used by sanctioned psykers to channel biomancy. Fires bolts that inject healing omnizine on impact.

ent-WeaponPsykerForceStaffPyromantic = pyromantic force staff
    .desc = A force stave shaped for pyromancy. Switching modes allows choosing between a stream of warpfire and a fireball — the most spectacular and destructive of sanctioned battlefield disciplines.

ent-WeaponPsykerForceStaffPsychic = psychic force staff
    .desc = A force stave built as a direct conduit for disciplined warp discharge. Imperial psykers use such weapons to hurl compact blasts of mind-driven force at short range.

ent-WeaponPsykerForceStaffTelekinetic = telekinetic force staff
    .desc = A force stave aligned to telekinetic practice. Its shock-bolt strikes like an invisible hammer, flinging foes with compressed force drawn from the Immaterium.

ent-WH40KProjectilePsykerWarpfireBolt = warpfire bolt
    .desc = A lance of mind-shaped flame drawn from the Immaterium.

ent-WH40KProjectilePsykerFireball = warp fireball
    .desc = A concentrated sphere of warpflame, ready to explode on contact.

ent-WH40KProjectilePsykerBiomanticBolt = biomantic bolt
    .desc = A bolt of concentrated biomantic energy carrying healing omnizine.
